flowchart TB
    subgraph ANALYSIS[Local email analysis]
        UI[Streamlit input] --> VAL[Validation and normalization]
        VAL --> TEXT[TF-IDF text features]
        VAL --> URL[Offline URL and sender checks<br/>No network requests]
        TEXT --> MODEL[Local selected classifier]
        MODEL --> RESULT[Three-class prediction<br/>Score, warning signals, next step]
        URL --> RESULT
    end
    RESULT --> DB[(SQLite metadata history<br/>No subject, body or raw URLs)]
    DB --> DASH[Dashboard and sanitized CSV]
    REVIEW[Human analyst review] --> DB
    REVIEW -. separate from model training .-> MANUAL[Retraining is manual only]
    subgraph TRAINING[Explicit local training]
        CSV[Approved or synthetic labeled CSV] --> DEDUP[Validate and deduplicate]
        DEDUP --> SPLIT[Train / validation / test split]
        SPLIT --> COMPARE[Compare LR and Random Forest<br/>Select by validation macro F1]
        COMPARE --> ART[Selected model + test report]
    end
    ART --> MODEL
